    "When a task needs current information, PrivateAI may send a search query to DuckDuckGo or fetch a website you requested. Nearby searches use your location only after your request authorizes it. These actions are shown in the conversation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当任务需要最新信息时，PrivateAI 可能会向 DuckDuckGo 发送搜索查询，或读取你请求的网站。仅当你的请求授权后，附近搜索才会使用位置信息。这些操作会显示在对话中。"
